\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {2}{\ignorespaces The main pair (top) and the endpoints used where noted (bottom). LoRA learning rate $3.53{\times }10^{-4}$, full FT $2{\times }10^{-5}$; batch 128; seed 316; training stops when validation loss stops improving (eps/k rule). Exact match $=$ 0-shot accuracy on 1,024 held-out problems. The 4M file is the 1M file plus 3M new unique problems, disjoint from every evaluation set.}}{2}{table.2}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{tab:endpoints}{{2}{2}{The main pair (top) and the endpoints used where noted (bottom). LoRA learning rate $3.53{\times }10^{-4}$, full FT $2{\times }10^{-5}$; batch 128; seed 316; training stops when validation loss stops improving (eps/k rule). Exact match $=$ 0-shot accuracy on 1,024 held-out problems. The 4M file is the 1M file plus 3M new unique problems, disjoint from every evaluation set}{table.2}{}}
